WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.529
This query partitions employees by department and
orders salary descending RANK

00:00:06.556 --> 00:00:12.524
restarts at one for each department Run the query
and notice the boundaries

00:00:12.551 --> 00:00:18.428
between departments This is a common pattern for top
earners top products

00:00:18.638 --> 00:00:20.783
or highest values within categories
